              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kar"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I assembled this seasoning to use on the Maple Cajun Mahi Mahi recipe from this site. It definitely gives you those traditional cajun flavors. For us, it was a little too hot, so next time I'll cut back on the cayenne powder. I will probably try adding 1T onion powder and 2T garlic powder next time, as others have suggested. This recipe is easy enough to customize to your personal tastes.",
